    <div id="root"><div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col"><nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-cream/80 backdrop-blur-md"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between h-[4.5rem]"><a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 group" aria-label="SPACE — home" href="/"><span class="text-ink transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-60"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="flex-shrink-0"><rect x="0" y="0" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></rect><rect x="7" y="0" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="13" y="0" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.25"></rect><rect x="0" y="7" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="7" y="7" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></rect><rect x="13" y="7" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="0" y="13" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.25"></rect><rect x="7" y="13" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="13" y="13" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></rect></svg></span><span class="text-ink font-display font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[1.0625rem] transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-60">SPACE</span></a><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8"><a class="type-ui transition-colors duration-200 font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/how-it-works/">How It Works</a><a class="type-ui transition-colors duration-200 font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/sell/">Sell</a><a class="type-ui transition-colors duration-200 font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/calculator/">Calculator</a><a class="type-ui px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors duration-200" href="/apply/">Request a free catalog review</a></div><button class="md:hidden p-2 -mr-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors" aria-label="Open menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu h-[18px] w-[18px]"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button></div></div><div class="md:hidden overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="border-t border-black/[0.08] bg-cream/98 backdrop-blur-2xl px-6 py-5"><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5"><a class="type-ui py-3.5 transition-colors font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/how-it-works/">How It Works</a><a class="type-ui py-3.5 transition-colors font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/sell/">Sell</a><a class="type-ui py-3.5 transition-colors font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/calculator/">Calculator</a><div class="pt-4 mt-3 border-t border-black/[0.08] space-y-2"><a class="type-ui block text-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors" href="/apply/">Request a free catalog review</a></div></div></div></div></nav><section class="bg-cream pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-28"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><nav class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-8"><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors" href="/compare/">Comparisons</a><span class="mx-2">/</span><span class="text-ink">SPACE vs <!-- -->Royalty Exchange</span></nav><h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-[1.1] text-ink">SPACE vs Royalty Exchange: Which Is Better for Selling Your Music Catalog?</h1><p class="text-xl text-ink-muted font-light max-w-2xl">If you're considering selling your music catalog or a portion of your royalties, two names you'll likely encounter are Royalty Exchange and SPACE. While both help music creators monetize their work, they operate in fundamentally different ways. Royalty Exchange is an established auction marketplace founded in 2011 with over 2,300 completed transactions, connecting creators with investors who bid on royalty streams. SPACE, on the other hand, is a direct buyer that specializes in ambient, lo-fi, and wellness music — offering creators a straightforward sale without the uncertainty of an auction. This comparison breaks down the key differences so you can decide which platform better fits your needs.</p></div></section><main class="flex-grow"><section class="bg-white py-10 border-b border-black/10"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Quick verdict</p><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">Royalty Exchange runs an auction-style marketplace where investors bid on your royalties, typically charging around 15% commission. SPACE buys catalogs directly with no auction or commission, specializing in ambient, lo-fi, and wellness music. Choose Royalty Exchange if you want competitive bidding on a mainstream catalog; choose SPACE for a fast, direct sale of ambient or meditation music.</p></div></section><section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="rounded-2xl p-7 bg-dark text-white"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">SPACE</h2><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 text-ink-muted">SPACE (spacemusic.io) is a music rights buyer that focuses exclusively on ambient, lo-fi, meditation, and wellness genres. Rather than listing your catalog on a marketplace, SPACE evaluates your music and makes a direct offer. The process is designed to be fast and transparent, with payouts typically arriving within days of accepting an offer. SPACE also supports partial rights sales, allowing creators to sell a share of their royalties while retaining ownership and creative control.</p><div class="mb-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-ink-faint">Strengths</p><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-white/60">Direct offers with no auction uncertainty</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-white/60">No commission or listing fees</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-white/60">Deep expertise in ambient, lo-fi, and wellness music valuation</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-white/60">Partial rights sales available — sell a percentage without giving up full ownership</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-white/60">Fast turnaround from submission to payout</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-white/60">Creators retain creative control over their music</span></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-ink-faint">Limitations</p><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-ink-muted">Focused on ambient, lo-fi, and wellness genres — not suitable for all music styles</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-ink-muted">Smaller operation compared to large-scale marketplace platforms</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-ink-muted">Offer price is fixed rather than determined by competitive bidding</span></li></ul></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl text-sm bg-white/8"><span class="font-medium text-white">Best for: </span><span class="text-white/60">Indie creators in the ambient, lo-fi, and wellness space who want a quick, direct sale with no commission and the option to retain partial ownership.</span></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl p-7 bg-cream"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-foreground">Royalty Exchange</h2><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 text-muted-foreground">Royalty Exchange is an online marketplace founded in 2011 where music creators list their royalty streams for auction. Investors browse available listings and place competitive bids, with the highest bidder winning the rights. The platform has facilitated over 2,300 transactions across all genres and royalty types. Royalty Exchange charges a commission (typically around 15%) on completed sales.</p><div class="mb-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-ink-muted">Strengths</p><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Established marketplace with a large pool of active investors</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Competitive bidding can drive up the final sale price</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Accepts all genres and royalty types (publishing, master, sync, etc.)</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Transparent auction process with visible bid history</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">+</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Over a decade of operational track record</span></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-ink-muted">Limitations</p><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Commission of approximately 15% reduces the seller's net proceeds</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Auction outcomes are uncertain — listings may not attract sufficient bids</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">The auction process typically takes several weeks to complete</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Less personalized evaluation for niche genres like ambient or meditation</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">−</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Requires sellers to provide detailed financial documentation upfront</span></li></ul></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl text-sm bg-white"><span class="font-medium text-foreground">Best for: </span><span class="text-muted-foreground">Creators with established, genre-diverse catalogs generating consistent royalties who want competitive market-driven pricing.</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-cream py-16 md:py-20"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Feature comparison</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-black/10"><th class="text-left py-3 pr-6 font-medium text-ink-faint text-xs uppercase tracking-wider w-1/3">Feature</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-medium text-ink-faint text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">SPACE</th><th class="text-left py-3 pl-4 font-medium text-ink-faint text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Royalty Exchange</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Deal type</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Direct purchase — fixed offer</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">Auction marketplace — investor bidding</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Genre focus</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Ambient, lo-fi, meditation, wellness</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">All genres and royalty types</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Commission / fees</td><td class="py-4 px-4">No commission or listing fees</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">~15% commission on completed sales</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Payout speed</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Typically within days of acceptance</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">Weeks (auction duration + settlement)</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Partial rights sales</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Yes — sell a percentage of your royalties</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">Limited — most deals transfer full royalty streams</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Minimum catalog size</td><td class="py-4 px-4">No strict minimum; welcomes smaller catalogs</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">Listings generally need consistent royalty income to attract bidders</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Creative control</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Retained by the creator</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">Varies by deal structure</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Process complexity</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Simple: submit, receive offer, accept or decline</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">More involved: documentation, listing setup, auction management</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Valuation approach</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Human evaluation with mood-music expertise</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">Market-driven pricing through investor bids</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-black/[0.06]"><td class="py-4 pr-6 font-medium text-muted-foreground">Track record</td><td class="py-4 px-4">Newer entrant focused on niche market</td><td class="py-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground">2,300+ transactions since 2011</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-16"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Our verdict</p><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl text-lg">Both platforms serve real needs, but they're built for different situations. Royalty Exchange is a strong choice if you have a catalog with broad appeal and consistent earnings — competitive bidding from multiple investors can maximize your sale price, though you'll pay a commission and wait longer for the process to complete. SPACE is the better fit if you create ambient, lo-fi, or wellness music and want a fast, straightforward sale with no fees. The direct-offer model removes auction uncertainty, and partial rights options give you flexibility that's harder to find on marketplace platforms. Neither is objectively "better" — it depends on your genre, catalog size, and how much control and speed matter to you.</p></div></section><section class="bg-cream py-16"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Common questions</p><div class="w-full" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-black/10"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:Rj5j:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R35j:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]>svg]:rotate-180 text-base font-medium py-5 hover:no-underline text-left" data-radix-collection-item="">Does Royalty Exchange buy music catalogs directly?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:Rj5j:" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R35j:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-black/10"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:Rl5j:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R55j:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]>svg]:rotate-180 text-base font-medium py-5 hover:no-underline text-left" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I sell only part of my royalties on SPACE?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:Rl5j:" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R55j:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-black/10"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:Rn5j:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R75j:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]>svg]:rotate-180 text-base font-medium py-5 hover:no-underline text-left" data-radix-collection-item="">How long does a Royalty Exchange auction take?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:Rn5j:" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R75j:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-black/10"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:Rp5j:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R95j:" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]>svg]:rotate-180 text-base font-medium py-5 hover:no-underline text-left" data-radix-collection-item="">Is SPACE only for ambient and lo-fi music?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:Rp5j:" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R95j:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Royalty Exchange buy music catalogs directly?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Royalty Exchange operates as a marketplace, connecting sellers with third-party investors who bid on royalty streams. The platform facilitates the transaction and charges a commission but does not purchase catalogs itself."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I sell only part of my royalties on SPACE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. SPACE offers partial rights sales, meaning you can sell a percentage of your future royalties while retaining ownership and creative control of your music. This is useful if you want upfront capital without giving up your entire catalog."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a Royalty Exchange auction take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A typical auction on Royalty Exchange runs for about 30 days, though the total process — including documentation, listing review, and post-auction settlement — can take several weeks longer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is SPACE only for ambient and lo-fi music?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SPACE specializes in ambient, lo-fi, meditation, and wellness music. If your catalog falls outside these genres, Royalty Exchange or other generalist platforms may be a better fit."}}]}</script></div></section><section class="bg-white py-12"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Sources</p><ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5"><li class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a href="https://www.royaltyexchange.com/how-it-works" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-2">Royalty Exchange — How It Works</a></li><li class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a href="https://www.musicbusinessworldwide.com/the-rise-of-music-royalty-marketplaces/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-2">Music Business Worldwide — The Rise of Music Royalty Marketplaces</a></li><li class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a href="https://www.billboard.com/pro/music-catalog-sales-explained/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-2">Billboard — Music Catalog Sales Explained</a></li><li class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a href="https://www.riaa.com/u-s-sales-database/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-2">RIAA — U.S. Recorded Music Revenues</a></li></ol></div></section><section class="bg-cream py-12"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-5">More comparisons</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="text-sm px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-black/10 hover:border-black/25 transition-colors" href="/compare/space-vs-hipgnosis/">SPACE vs <!-- -->Hipgnosis Songs Fund</a><a class="text-sm px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-black/10 hover:border-black/25 transition-colors" href="/compare/space-vs-duetti/">SPACE vs <!-- -->Duetti</a><a class="text-sm px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-black/10 hover:border-black/25 transition-colors" href="/compare/space-vs-primary-wave/">SPACE vs <!-- -->Primary Wave Music</a><a class="text-sm px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-black/10 hover:border-black/25 transition-colors" href="/compare/space-vs-reservoir/">SPACE vs <!-- -->Reservoir Media</a><a class="text-sm px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-black/10 hover:border-black/25 transition-colors" href="/compare/space-vs-round-hill/">SPACE vs <!-- -->Round Hill Music (now part of Concord)</a></div></div></section><section class="bg-dark text-white py-24 md:py-32"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-[1.1]">Ready to sell your catalog?</h2><p class="text-ink-muted mb-10 text-lg">Get a free valuation from SPACE. No obligation.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand text-white font-medium px-7 py-3.5 text-base rounded-full hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors" href="/calculator/">Try the Calculator</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-ink-muted font-medium px-7 py-3.5 text-base rounded-full hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/apply/">Request a free catalog review</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="bg-dark"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-20"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-10"><div class="space-y-8 md:col-span-5 min-w-0"><div class="space-y-2"><a class="font-display text-[1.375rem] font-semibold text-white tracking-[-0.04em]" href="/">SPACE</a><p class="type-small text-white/78 measure-narrow">We review revenue-generating music catalogs directly, across genres.</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><p class="type-caption text-white/65 uppercase font-medium">The Catalog Report</p><p class="type-small text-white/72">Bi-weekly market insights and creator tips.</p><form class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><input type="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required="" class="type-small flex-grow min-w-0 px-3 py-2 rounded-full text-white placeholder-white/55 focus:outline-none focus:border-white/50 transition-colors" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12)" value=""><button type="submit" class="type-small px-4 py-2 bg-brand text-white rounded-full hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 font-medium whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Subscribe</button></form></div></div><nav class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3"><span class="type-caption font-medium text-white/65 uppercase">Explore</span><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/how-it-works/">How It Works</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/sell/">Sell Your Catalog</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/calculator/">Calculator</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/about/">About</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/apply/">Request a free catalog review</a></li></ul></nav><nav class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-4"><span class="type-caption font-medium text-white/65 uppercase">Learn</span><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/guides/how-to-sell-music-rights/">Selling Guide</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/guides/music-rights-101/">Music Rights 101</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/guides/music-catalog-valuation-2026/">Valuation Guide</a></li><li><a class="type-small text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/guides/what-are-your-streams-worth-2026/">Streams Worth</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><p class="type-caption text-white/70">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> SPACE. All rights reserved.</p><a class="type-caption text-white/65 hover:text-white/90 transition-colors" href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="mailto:hello@spacemusic.io" class="type-caption text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">hello@spacemusic.io</a></div><div class="flex gap-5"><a href="#" aria-label="Twitter" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-twitter h-4 w-4"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"></path></svg></a><a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-linkedin h-4 w-4"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"></rect><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg></a></div></div></div></footer></div></div>
  <script data-space-seo-links="true">
(() => {
  const normalizeInternalLinks = () => {
    document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="/"]').forEach((anchor) => {
      const href = anchor.getAttribute('href');
      if (!href || href === '/' || href.startsWith('/#') || href.startsWith('/assets/')) return;
      const url = new URL(href, window.location.origin);
      if (url.pathname.endsWith('/') || /\.[^/]+$/.test(url.pathname)) return;
      anchor.setAttribute('href', url.pathname + '/' + url.search + url.hash);
    });
  };
  normalizeInternalLinks();
  new MutationObserver(normalizeInternalLinks).observe(document.documentElement, {childList: true, subtree: true});
})();
</script>
  

</body></html>